# Backend Requirements — 43rd AEAA Conference Portal

> **Document version:** 1.0 — 30 September 2026
> **Audience:** Backend developer(s)
> **Frontend repo:** `aeaa_FE`

---

## 1. Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph LR
    FE["React Frontend"] -- REST/JSON --> API["Backend API Server"]
    API -- SMTP --> MAIL["Email Service (aeaa2027@neco.gov.ng)"]
    API -- ORM --> DB[(Database)]
    API -- Disk / S3 --> FS["File Storage"]
```

| Concern | Recommendation |
|---|---|
| **Runtime** | Python (FastAPI) |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL | dtabase name is aeaa_db
| **Auth** | JWT (access + refresh tokens) |
| **Email** | Nodemailer / Django `send_mail` via institutional SMTP or a transactional service (e.g., Mailgun, SendGrid) |
| **File Storage** | Local disk for MVP; migrate to S3-compatible bucket for production |
| **Hosting** | The API should expose a `/api` prefix. The frontend will call these endpoints. CORS must allow the frontend origin. |

---

## 2. Data Models

### 2.1 [User](file:///g:/Projects/aeaa_FE/src/context/AuthContext.tsx#5-15)

| Field | Type | Constraints | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| [id](file:///g:/Projects/aeaa_FE/src/context/AuthContext.tsx#44-84) | UUID | PK, auto | — |
| `fullName` | VARCHAR(255) | NOT NULL | From Registration form |
| `email` | VARCHAR(255) | NOT NULL, UNIQUE | Used for login |
| `password` | VARCHAR(255) | NOT NULL | Hashed (bcrypt / argon2) |
| `organization` | VARCHAR(255) | — | "Organisation / Institution" field |
| `country` | VARCHAR(100) | — | — |
| `phoneNumber` | VARCHAR(30) | — | — |
| `role` | ENUM('USER','ADMIN') | DEFAULT 'USER' | — |
| `registrationPackage` | VARCHAR(100) | — | `"Registration Fee Only ($650)"` or `"Registration + Excursion ($750)"` |
| `paymentStatus` | ENUM('PENDING','COMPLETED') | DEFAULT 'PENDING' | Admin toggles this |
| `createdAt` | TIMESTAMP | auto | — |
| `updatedAt` | TIMESTAMP | auto | — |

